{"seq":3,"slug":"gc-latency-tuning-and-leaks","title":"GC 延迟调优与泄漏猎捕：STW 分布、finalizer/大对象、对象驻留与增长型泄漏定位","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/go-runtime-gc-scheduler-internals-gmp/tricolor-gc-write-barrier/gc-latency-tuning-and-leaks","wordCount":2725,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"gc-延迟调优与泄漏猎捕-stw-分布-finalizer-大对象-对象驻留与增长型泄漏定位\">GC 延迟调优与泄漏猎捕：STW 分布、finalizer/大对象、对象驻留与增长型泄漏定位</h1><p>一个跨境订单服务把 <code>GOGC</code> 从 100 调到 400 后，P99 延迟「好转」了两周，然后订单服务开始 OOM——这次不是 GC 太慢，而是 GC 被喂饱之后<strong>该回收的对象没被回收</strong>。延迟调优与泄漏猎捕是一枚硬币的两面：<code>GOGC</code>/<code>GOMEMLIMIT</code> 决定 GC 何时跑（见同章 <a href=\"gc-phases-pacer-and-assist\">GC 四阶段与 Pacer</a>），写屏障决定 GC 跑得对不对（见同章 <a href=\"tricolor-invariant-and-barriers\">三色不变式与屏障类型</a>）；而真正决定线上尾延迟的，是<strong>暂停的分布</strong>、<strong>非托管生命周期（finalizer/大对象）<strong>和</strong>驻留集合的缓慢增长</strong>。本文按可核验的运行时源码与官方文档，把这三件事拆开。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-三种暂停来源与它们各自的量级\">核心概念：三种暂停来源与它们各自的量级</h2><p>讨论「STW 有多长」之前先要分清<strong>是哪一种暂停</strong>。Go 的 STW 分三类，它们的时长由完全不同的变量决定，混在一起谈就会调错旋钮。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>暂停类型</th>\n<th>谁触发</th>\n<th>时长由什么决定</th>\n<th>观测点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>GC 阶段 STW（清扫终止 / 标记终止）</td>\n<td>GC 循环</td>\n<td>每次 <strong>~10–100 µs</strong>，与堆大小<strong>弱相关</strong>（分布式终止检查已在并发段完成）</td>\n<td><code>gctrace</code> 行尾 <code>+x+y ms</code> 的 <code>y</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>栈扫描 STW（<code>stopTheWorld</code> / <code>startTheWorld</code> 的 sysmon 抢占）</td>\n<td>标记进入与 goroutine 栈扫描</td>\n<td>与 <strong><code>GOMAXPROCS</code> 和 goroutine 数量</strong>相关，与堆大小<strong>无关</strong></td>\n<td><code>runtime/trace</code> 的 STW 事件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>调度抢占暂停（<code>asyncPreempt</code>）</td>\n<td>sysmon 每 10ms 检查长跑 goroutine</td>\n<td>单 goroutine，通常 <strong>µs 级</strong></td>\n<td>CPU profile 中的 <code>runtime.asyncPreempt</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>关键认知在 <a href=\"https://go.dev/doc/gc-guide\">Go GC Guide</a>：<strong>Go 的 STW 暂停不随堆大小增长</strong>——这一点常被误解。<code>GODEBUG=gctrace=1</code> 每行的 <code>gc N @T s X%: a+b+c+d ms clock, ...</code> 中，<code>clock</code> 字段的 <code>+b</code> 与 <code>+d</code> 相加才是真正的 STW 时间。一个 30GB 堆的服务，标记终止 STW 仍在 100µs 量级；真正把 P99 推高的往往是<strong>并发标记期间的 CPU 抢占</strong>（mark assist 抢了用户 goroutine 的 CPU），而不是 STW 本身。</p>\n<p>设标记阶段理想占用 25% CPU，缺口 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>g</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span> 由 assist 补：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mfrac><mtext>allocRate</mtext><mtext>scanRate</mtext></mfrac><mo>−</mo><mn>0.25</mn><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g = \\max\\left(0,\\ \\frac{\\text{allocRate}}{\\text{scanRate}} - 0.25\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">scanRate</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">allocRate</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.25</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><code>allocRate</code> 是你的分配速率。<strong>降尾延迟的第一杠杆不是调 GC，而是降分配速率</strong>：把热点路径上的 <code>[]byte</code> 拼接、临时 map、<code>fmt.Sprintf</code> 换成 <code>sync.Pool</code> 或预分配缓冲，assist 就自然消失。指南给的诊断阈值：<code>runtime.gcAssistAlloc</code> 累计占比 &gt; 5% 说明分配速率显著快于标记进度；<code>runtime.mallocgc</code> 占比 &gt; 15% 说明分配本身过重。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[&quot;P99 延迟升高&quot;] --&gt; B{&quot;gctrace 看 +y STW 段&quot;}&#10;    B --&gt;|STW 段 &gt; 1ms| C[&quot;检查标记终止阶段&lt;br/&gt;GOMAXPROCS 过高? 大量 goroutine 栈?&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt;|STW 段正常| D{&quot;CPU profile 看 gcAssistAlloc&quot;}&#10;    D --&gt;|占比 &gt; 5%| E[&quot;分配速率过快&lt;br/&gt;→ sync.Pool / 预分配 / 减少逃逸&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt;|占比正常| F{&quot;看 gcDrainMarkWorkerIdle&quot;}&#10;    F --&gt;|占比高| G[&quot;应用空闲核多&lt;br/&gt;非 bug;或 GOMAXPROCS 配得过大&quot;]&#10;    F --&gt;|都不显著| H[&quot;排除 GC,查锁/下游/GC limiter&quot;]\">graph TD\n    A[\"P99 延迟升高\"] --&gt; B{\"gctrace 看 +y STW 段\"}\n    B --&gt;|STW 段 &gt; 1ms| C[\"检查标记终止阶段&lt;br/&gt;GOMAXPROCS 过高? 大量 goroutine 栈?\"]\n    B --&gt;|STW 段正常| D{\"CPU profile 看 gcAssistAlloc\"}\n    D --&gt;|占比 &gt; 5%| E[\"分配速率过快&lt;br/&gt;→ sync.Pool / 预分配 / 减少逃逸\"]\n    D --&gt;|占比正常| F{\"看 gcDrainMarkWorkerIdle\"}\n    F --&gt;|占比高| G[\"应用空闲核多&lt;br/&gt;非 bug;或 GOMAXPROCS 配得过大\"]\n    F --&gt;|都不显著| H[\"排除 GC,查锁/下游/GC limiter\"]</pre><p><code>GOMAXPROCS</code> 是这里最容易被误配的旋钮。容器里若 <code>GOMAXPROCS</code> 远大于实际可用核，标记 worker 之间互相抢占会同时抬高 assist 时间与调度延迟；Go 1.25 起运行时默认<strong>容器感知</strong>（读取 cgroup CPU quota 自动设置 <code>GOMAXPROCS</code>，见 <a href=\"https://go.dev/doc/go1.25\">Go 1.25 release notes</a> 的 runtime 段），但显式在 <code>main</code> 里调 <code>runtime.GOMAXPROCS(n)</code> 或设环境变量仍会覆盖它。若你的服务曾用第三方 <code>automaxprocs</code> 打补丁，升级到 Go 1.25+ 后可以先量再删。</p>\n<h2 id=\"finalizer-与-addcleanup-延迟尾巴上的确定性成本\">finalizer 与 AddCleanup：延迟尾巴上的确定性成本</h2><p><code>runtime.SetFinalizer</code> 是 Go 里唯一一种「回收时机不确定、且会二次复活对象」的机制。它的成本不在 finalizer 函数本身，而在<strong>对象的生命周期被拉长一整个 GC 周期</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>对象在第一次被判定不可达时，<strong>不会被立即回收</strong>，而是被挂到 finalizer 队列。</li>\n<li>运行时启动一个<strong>专用 goroutine</strong>（<code>runfinq</code>）逐个调用 finalizer。该 goroutine 的推进速度与分配速率无关——如果 finalizer 里做了 I/O 或重活，队列会积压，被 pending 的对象全部滞留。</li>\n<li>只有一个 GC 周期<strong>之后</strong>（finalizer 已跑、且不再被引用），对象才真正进入可回收状态。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>因此 SetFinalizer 的两个后果是可量化的：<strong>驻留内存至少多一个 GC 周期</strong>，并且**<code>runtime.fin</code> goroutine 的 CPU 会出现在 profile 里**。对持有 <code>os.File</code>、<code>unsafe.Pointer</code>、C 内存的对象，更严重的问题是 finalizer 可能永远不跑（进程不 GC 就不触发），造成 fd 泄漏。</p>\n<p>Go 1.24 引入了 <strong><code>runtime.AddCleanup</code></strong> 作为推荐替代（<a href=\"https://go.dev/doc/go1.24\">Go 1.24 release notes</a>；<code>runtime.AddCleanup</code> 见 <a href=\"https://pkg.go.dev/runtime\">pkg.go.dev/runtime</a>）。它与 SetFinalizer 的差别值得记住：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th><code>SetFinalizer</code></th>\n<th><code>AddCleanup</code></th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>一个对象可挂几个清理器</td>\n<td>仅 1 个</td>\n<td>多个</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>引用环</td>\n<td>对象可复活自己，需手动 <code>SetFinalizer(obj, nil)</code> 打破</td>\n<td>清理器是独立对象，不复活目标</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>是否需同类型</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>否，可对任意 <code>*T</code> 挂</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>重新挂载</td>\n<td>允许从 finalizer 里再挂</td>\n<td>不允许（<code>AddCleanup</code> 拒绝重挂）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>大对象/小对象统一</td>\n<td>有历史特例</td>\n<td>统一路径</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>实务原则</strong>：需要释放的是 <strong><code>os.File</code>、<code>C.malloc</code> 返回的内存、<code>mmap</code> 区域</strong>这类确定资源时，<strong>不要依赖 finalizer</strong>——finalizer 是兜底，不是资源管理。正确的做法是显式 <code>Close</code>/<code>Free</code>，并把 finalizer 或 <code>AddCleanup</code> 只作为「忘了关」的告警探针（在 finalizer 里 <code>log</code> 一条 warning），这样既能兜底又能暴露调用方缺陷。若 finalizer 报出「本应已关闭」的对象，直接定位调用栈远比在延迟曲线里事后猜测便宜。</p>\n<h2 id=\"大对象-逃逸分析与内存驻留\">大对象、逃逸分析与内存驻留</h2><p>32KB 是 Go 内存分配器的尺寸分水岭：<code>_MaxSmallSize = 32 &lt;&lt; 10</code>，<strong>大于 32KB 的分配不走 mcache/mcentral，直接由 mheap 以 span 级别的页对齐方式分配</strong>（见 <a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/golang/go/master/src/runtime/sizeclasses.go\">runtime/sizeclasses.go</a> 与 <a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/golang/go/master/src/runtime/malloc.go\">runtime/malloc.go</a>）。这带来三个必须知道的驻留效应：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>大对象是整 span 分配的</strong>。一个 40KB 的对象占用至少 48KB 的 span（8KB 页对齐后的最近尺寸类），碎片率随请求尺寸偏离 2 的幂而升高。</li>\n<li><strong>大对象的清扫更晚</strong>。清扫是并发的、惰性的，大 span 归还 mheap 又被分配出去的节律与最终 GC 周期耦合。</li>\n<li><strong>大对象不经过 tiny allocator</strong>，<code>sync.Pool</code> 对它们收益有限；反而更该考虑复用（对象池/ring buffer）而不是每次新建。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>逃逸分析（<code>go build -gcflags=-m</code>）决定变量是<strong>栈分配</strong>还是<strong>堆分配</strong>。常见的「隐性逃逸」把小的栈对象推成大的堆驻留：把局部变量取地址后放进 <code>interface{}</code>、把 slice 传进 <code>for range</code> 的 <code>append</code>、把 <code>defer</code> 里的闭包捕获到堆。<strong>每次分配都进 GC 的记账</strong>——减少逃逸等于减少 <code>allocRate</code>，等于减少 assist，等于降尾延迟。</p>\n<p>驻留集合（live set）才是决定 <code>goal</code> 的量。pacer 的目标公式（见 <a href=\"gc-phases-pacer-and-assist\">GC 四阶段与 Pacer</a>）中：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>g</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>H</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>k</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>H</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>k</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>k</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>b</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>×</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>G</mi><mi>O</mi><mi>G</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mn>100</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">goal = H_{marked} + (H_{marked} + S_{stack} + S_{globals}) \\times \\frac{GOGC}{100}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ba</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">100</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">GO</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">GC</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><strong>注意 <code>H_marked</code>（已标记存活堆）是乘数基底</strong>：只要存活堆在增长，目标堆就以同样斜率增长，<code>GOGC=100</code> 意味着「稳态下堆开销约为存活堆的 2 倍」。所以一个不看存活堆、只看 RSS 就调大 <code>GOGC</code> 的动作，实际上是在<strong>放大泄漏的绝对量</strong>——这也是开头那个订单服务 OOM 的机制。</p>\n<p>内存归还与延迟的关系由 <code>GOMEMLIMIT</code> 调节。设限制 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span>，则堆目标被反推为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>g</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>a</mi><msub><mi>l</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msub><mi>H</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>k</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>L</mi><mo>−</mo><mtext>nonHeapMapped</mtext><mo>−</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>g</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi><mo>×</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mn>100</mn></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mn>1</mn><mtext>MiB</mtext><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">goal_{mem} = \\max\\left(H_{marked},\\ L - \\text{nonHeapMapped} - \\max\\left(\\frac{goal \\times 3}{100},\\ 1\\text{MiB}\\right)\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0197em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">nonHeapMapped</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">100</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">MiB</span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 3% 与 1MiB 取大者是给「运行时不知道的内存来源」留的余量（<a href=\"https://pkg.go.dev/runtime/debug\">pkg.go.dev/runtime/debug</a>）。配得过低会触发 <strong>GC thrashing</strong>：Go 1.19 的 GC CPU limiter 在此时把 GC 总 CPU 钳在 <strong>~50%</strong>（测量窗口 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>×</mo><mi>G</mi><mi>O</mi><mi>M</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>X</mi><mi>P</mi><mi>R</mi><mi>O</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2 \\times GOMAXPROCS</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">GO</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span> CPU 秒，含滞后），宁可让内存短暂超过软限制也不停摆——所以限制配得过低的<strong>最坏情况是约 2× 降速</strong>，务必给容器留 <strong>5%–10%</strong> 余量。</p>\n<h2 id=\"增长型泄漏猎捕-从-rss-曲线到对象图\">增长型泄漏猎捕：从 RSS 曲线到对象图</h2><p>「内存泄漏」在 Go 里几乎总不是真泄漏，而是<strong>增长型驻留</strong>——对象仍被某条可达路径引用，GC 行为完全正确。定位顺序应当是「先证伪 GC，再找持有者」。</p>\n<p><strong>第一步：区分驻留增长与 GC 延迟。</strong> 采集 <code>runtime/metrics</code> 的两个量：<code>/memory/classes/heap/objects:bytes</code>（活跃对象字节）与 <code>/gc/heap/goal:bytes</code>。若前者随时间单调增长，确定是驻留泄漏；若只是后者锯齿变大而前者平稳，是配置问题不是泄漏。这个判据比 <code>runtime.ReadMemStats</code> 的 <code>HeapAlloc</code> 更精确，因为 <code>/memory/classes/*</code> 直接来自运行时分类。</p>\n<p><strong>第二步：让对象图说话。</strong> 泄漏猎捕的标准动作是<strong>堆快照差分</strong>：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>触发 <code>runtime.GC()</code> 两次确保 finalizer/清扫收敛。</li>\n<li>用 <code>runtime/pprof</code> 的 <code>pprof.WriteHeapProfile</code> 拿一份 <code>inuse_space</code> 快照；Go 1.21+ 可改用 <code>runtime/pprof</code> 的 <strong><code>pprof.Lookup(&quot;goroutine&quot;)</code></strong> 与 <code>/debug/pprof/heap?debug=1</code>。</li>\n<li>让可疑流量（比如某类订单）跑一段时间。</li>\n<li>再取一份快照，用 <code>go tool pprof -base before.pb.gz after.pb.gz</code> 做<strong>差分</strong>，只看新增的分配点。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>差分能过滤掉背景堆，把「谁在增长」直接定位到源码行。若增长来自 <code>goroutine</code> 数量而非字节，用 <code>go tool pprof http://.../debug/pprof/goroutine</code> 看 goroutine 栈聚合——<strong>goroutine 泄漏</strong>（如无缓冲 channel 上永久阻塞的 worker、未取消的 <code>context</code>）表现为 goroutine 计数单调上升，其占用的栈内存（每 goroutine 初始 2KB，可涨到 1MB）最终压垮进程。</p>\n<p><strong>第三步：三类高频根因。</strong></p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>症状</th>\n<th>常见根因</th>\n<th>修复方向</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>map/slice 单调增长</td>\n<td>无界缓存、无淘汰的 <code>sync.Map</code>、全局 registry 从不删除</td>\n<td>加容量上限 + LRU/分片淘汰；或按 TTL 定期清</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>goroutine 计数只增不减</td>\n<td><code>context</code> 未取消、channel 无接收方、<code>time.Ticker</code> 未 <code>Stop</code></td>\n<td>用 <code>context.WithCancel</code> 串起来；<code>defer ticker.Stop()</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>定期「不释放」的驻留尖峰</td>\n<td><code>sync.Pool</code> 在两次 GC 间保留对象（这是设计行为，非 bug）；或 finalizer 队列积压</td>\n<td>检查 <code>runtime.fin</code> goroutine CPU；用 <code>runtime.MemProfile</code> 确认对象仍可达</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>大对象永不归还 OS</td>\n<td>大 span 归还 mheap 但未 <code>scavenge</code></td>\n<td>配 <code>GOMEMLIMIT</code> 或用 <code>debug.FreeOSMemory()</code>（谨慎，会强制 GC）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><code>sync.Pool</code> 的一个常见误判值得单独提醒：<strong>它保证「不保证长期存活」</strong>——对象在某次 GC 后被清空是设计，不是泄漏；反过来，波动大的驻留往往正来自 Pool 里缓存的对象。用 <code>pin</code> 在上限内保留池大小是常见做法，但要清楚这等于把「短期缓存」变成「驻留」。</p>\n<p><strong>第四步：把猎捕固化成常态。</strong> 一次性定位不是终点。把 <code>/memory/classes/heap/objects:bytes</code> 和 <code>/sched/goroutines:goroutines</code> 打进监控，给「N 小时内驻留增长 &gt; 阈值」设告警，泄漏就从「上线三个月后 OOM」变成「当天发现」。这也解释了为什么观测性要与 GC 调优同章（见同 hub <a href=\"../observability-tuning-diagnostics/\">可观测性、调优与诊断</a>）——<strong>没有驻留曲线，任何 <code>GOGC</code> 调参都是盲调</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>STW 有三类来源</strong>，量级各异：GC 阶段 STW（~10–100µs，与堆大小弱相关）、栈扫描 STW（与 <code>GOMAXPROCS</code>/goroutine 数相关）、asyncPreempt 抢占（µs 级）。调延迟前先用 <code>gctrace</code> 分清是哪一类，别把 assist 抢 CPU 当成 STW 调 <code>GOGC</code>。</li>\n<li><strong>降尾延迟第一杠杆是降分配速率</strong>：<code>gcAssistAlloc</code> 占比 &gt; 5% 说明分配快过标记进度；<code>sync.Pool</code>、预分配、减少逃逸都比调 GC 参数直接。</li>\n<li><strong>finalizer 不是资源管理</strong>：它把对象驻留拉长至少一个 GC 周期，且 <code>runfinq</code> 是单 goroutine 会积压。新代码用 <code>runtime.AddCleanup</code>（Go 1.24+），并只把它当「忘了 Close」的告警探针。</li>\n<li><strong>32KB 是分配器分水岭</strong>：大对象走整 span，碎片与清扫节律都不同；逃逸分析决定栈还是堆，直接影响 <code>allocRate</code> 与 <code>goal</code>。</li>\n<li><strong><code>goal</code> 以存活堆为乘数基底</strong>：只看 RSS 调大 <code>GOGC</code> 会放大泄漏的绝对量。泄漏猎捕先证伪 GC（看 <code>/memory/classes/heap/objects:bytes</code>），再用 <code>pprof -base</code> 差分定位增长点，三类根因分别是无界缓存、goroutine 泄漏、Pool/finalizer 驻留。</li>\n<li><strong>配 <code>GOMEMLIMIT</code> 留 5%–10% 余量</strong>，过低会 thrashing；Go 1.19 的 GC CPU limiter 会把 GC 钳在 ~50%，最坏约 2× 降速。</li>\n<li><strong>把驻留与 goroutine 计数进监控</strong>：泄漏猎捕是常态化的，不是一次性的。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"GC 延迟调优与泄漏猎捕：STW 分布、finalizer/大对象、对象驻留与增长型泄漏定位","id":"gc-延迟调优与泄漏猎捕-stw-分布-finalizer-大对象-对象驻留与增长型泄漏定位"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：三种暂停来源与它们各自的量级","id":"核心概念-三种暂停来源与它们各自的量级"},{"level":2,"text":"finalizer 与 AddCleanup：延迟尾巴上的确定性成本","id":"finalizer-与-addcleanup-延迟尾巴上的确定性成本"},{"level":2,"text":"大对象、逃逸分析与内存驻留","id":"大对象-逃逸分析与内存驻留"},{"level":2,"text":"增长型泄漏猎捕：从 RSS 曲线到对象图","id":"增长型泄漏猎捕-从-rss-曲线到对象图"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"GC 四阶段与 Pacer：并发标记、mark assist、清扫与 GOGC/GOMEMLIMIT 反馈调节","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/go-runtime-gc-scheduler-internals-gmp/tricolor-gc-write-barrier/gc-phases-pacer-and-assist"},"next":{"title":"运行时可观测面：runtime/metrics、pprof（cpu/heap/block/mutex）与 execution trace 采样","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/go-runtime-gc-scheduler-internals-gmp/observability-tuning-diagnostics/runtime-metrics-pprof-trace"}}